---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import julian from '../assets/julian.jpg';
---

<section class="container" aria-labelledby="founder-title">
  <div class="left">
    <h2 id="founder-title">You’re a creator.<br /><span>I’m a lawyer.</span></h2>
    <Image src={julian} alt="Julian Sarafian, Founder" widths={[440, 880]} sizes="(min-width: 480px) 440px, 100vw" />
  </div>
  <div class="right">
    <p>Hi, I'm Julian Sarafian, our firm's Founder. It’s nice to meet you! After attending Berkeley and Harvard Law School I struck out on my own to represent the “little guys” in social media: content creators.</p>
    <p>For content creators, I also help them land brand deals so they can monetize and negotiate brand deal terms on their behalf to get them better deals. I know firsthand what it’s like to be a content creator because I’m one myself - currently reaching nearly 400,000 folks across various platforms.</p>
    <p>Reach out anytime for a free consult, I’d love to work together!</p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  section {
    padding-top: clamp(72px, 9vw, 128px);
    padding-bottom: clamp(72px, 9vw, 128px);
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 360px), 1fr));
    gap: clamp(40px, 6vw, 96px);
  }
  .left {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 32px;
  }
  h2 {
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: clamp(40px, 4.6vw, 68px);
    line-height: 1;
    margin: 0;
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
  }
  h2 span {
    color: var(--peri-mid);
  }
  .left :global(img) {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 440px;
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center 15%;
  }
  .right {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 20px;
    font-size: 20px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--body-ink);
    align-self: end;
  }
  .right p {
    margin: 0;
  }
</style>
